[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13383.59, "timestamp": "03:43:03", "text": "有些人，呃，我不知道，我想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13386.87, "timestamp": "03:43:06", "text": "成为一家面包店和美发沙龙。我的意思是，当"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13388.55, "timestamp": "03:43:08", "text": "涉及到身份盗窃、死亡和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13392.309, "timestamp": "03:43:12", "text": "东西对吧，我不知道，嗯，有些人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13395.269, "timestamp": "03:43:15", "text": "纯粹为了好玩之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13397.83, "timestamp": "03:43:17", "text": "对，有些人就是这么做的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13400.71, "timestamp": "03:43:20", "text": "有趣，但实际上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13403.51, "timestamp": "03:43:23", "text": "他们不知道自己是谁。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13405.75, "timestamp": "03:43:25", "text": "这样做是为了让他们感到痛苦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13407.269, "timestamp": "03:43:27", "text": "一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13409.349, "timestamp": "03:43:29", "text": "没错，他们当然是为了好玩才这么做的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13411.67, "timestamp": "03:43:31", "text": "呃，是互联网。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13413.83, "timestamp": "03:43:33", "text": "你可以看出，普通人也会恶意攻击别人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13416.79, "timestamp": "03:43:36", "text": "并在网上欺凌他人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13419.83, "timestamp": "03:43:39", "text": "为了好玩，因为我喜欢这样做，而且在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13423.11, "timestamp": "03:43:43", "text": "最终，那些受此影响的人会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13424.79, "timestamp": "03:43:44", "text": "经历了很多创伤，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13429.03, "timestamp": "03:43:49", "text": "一切都很好，但就是那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13431.99, "timestamp": "03:43:51", "text": "我的情况也是如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13433.91, "timestamp": "03:43:53", "text": "喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13437.189, "timestamp": "03:43:57", "text": "当你长大时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13439.189, "timestamp": "03:43:59", "text": "当你变得越来越大的时候"}]